{"id": "stories-p14121", "blocks": [{"id": "stories-p14121", "text": "Lamentations for the Rooms We Did Not Carry", "style": "TITLE", "sourceParagraph": 14121}, {"id": "stories-p14122", "text": "Late Era −2, after the Orison rescue · Choral poem cycle with a prose frame", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14122}, {"id": "stories-p14123", "text": "The recorder's preface", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 14123}, {"id": "stories-p14124", "text": "I am Aven. My contribution to the rescue was small: I kept a borrowed storage interval open while more competent people argued over its use. Afterward, I was asked to make an inventory of what former Orison required.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14124}, {"id": "stories-p14125", "text": "I expected capacity figures. I received descriptions of rooms.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14125}, {"id": "stories-p14126", "text": "One person requested a corridor with a bad turn. Another asked for a sound nobody could reconstruct. Several wanted privacy from the people who had saved them. I began separating practical requests from mourning. Serein asked to see the separation rule. I could not write one that survived their questions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14126}, {"id": "stories-p14127", "text": "These are the voices recorded at seven gatherings in the shared chamber. The English lines follow the turns of speaking; they are not a reconstruction of the original musical encoding. Some speakers withheld names. Absence of a name here is not absence of a person.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14127}, {"id": "stories-p14128", "text": "The last gathering was not the end of grief. It was the evening we stopped making people prove that grief prevented useful work.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14128}, {"id": "stories-p14129", "text": "I. Inventory of the missing room", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 14129}, {"id": "stories-p14130", "text": "FIRST VOICE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14130}, {"id": "stories-p14131", "text": "There was a turn in the corridor", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14131}, {"id": "stories-p14132", "text": "where every carrying body caught its side.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14132}, {"id": "stories-p14133", "text": "We petitioned three times to widen it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14133}, {"id": "stories-p14134", "text": "The third petition was approved.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14134}, {"id": "stories-p14135", "text": "The work had not begun.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14135}, {"id": "stories-p14136", "text": "I want that turn.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14136}, {"id": "stories-p14137", "text": "AVEN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14137}, {"id": "stories-p14138", "text": "You want the corridor restored?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14138}, {"id": "stories-p14139", "text": "FIRST VOICE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14139}, {"id": "stories-p14140", "text": "I want to have been annoyed by it", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14140}, {"id": "stories-p14141", "text": "without knowing I was fortunate.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14141}, {"id": "stories-p14142", "text": "SECOND VOICE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14142}, {"id": "stories-p14143", "text": "My room had no window.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14143}, {"id": "stories-p14144", "text": "I made a window.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14144}, {"id": "stories-p14145", "text": "Beyond it I arranged an unconvincing distance.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14145}, {"id": "stories-p14146", "text": "Visitors were kind about the distance.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14146}, {"id": "stories-p14147", "text": "I would like their kindness back,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14147}, {"id": "stories-p14148", "text": "and the privacy to improve it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14148}, {"id": "stories-p14149", "text": "CHORUS", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14149}, {"id": "stories-p14150", "text": "The room is gone.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14150}, {"id": "stories-p14151", "text": "The request remains.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14151}, {"id": "stories-p14152", "text": "THIRD VOICE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14152}, {"id": "stories-p14153", "text": "Do not write “a beautiful home.”", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14153}, {"id": "stories-p14154", "text": "The floor repeated near the entrance.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14154}, {"id": "stories-p14155", "text": "We could hear our neighbor's calculations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14155}, {"id": "stories-p14156", "text": "There was always somebody explaining", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14156}, {"id": "stories-p14157", "text": "how little capacity we had used.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14157}, {"id": "stories-p14158", "text": "It was a home.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14158}, {"id": "stories-p14159", "text": "You need not improve my evidence.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14159}, {"id": "stories-p14160", "text": "II. The receiving Shelter's song", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 14160}, {"id": "stories-p14161", "text": "RECEIVER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14161}, {"id": "stories-p14162", "text": "We cleared a place before you arrived.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14162}, {"id": "stories-p14163", "text": "We cleared another when the first was wrong.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14163}, {"id": "stories-p14164", "text": "We found that our simplest greeting", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14164}, {"id": "stories-p14165", "text": "entered your hearing as a demand.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14165}, {"id": "stories-p14166", "text": "We had practiced generosity", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14166}, {"id": "stories-p14167", "text": "with no guest present.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14167}, {"id": "stories-p14168", "text": "We were very good at it then.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14168}, {"id": "stories-p14169", "text": "Our child asked why your room stayed dark.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14169}, {"id": "stories-p14170", "text": "I answered for you.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14170}, {"id": "stories-p14171", "text": "You asked me not to.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14171}, {"id": "stories-p14172", "text": "I am learning to leave the question", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14172}, {"id": "stories-p14173", "text": "where another voice can reach it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14173}, {"id": "stories-p14174", "text": "GUEST", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14174}, {"id": "stories-p14175", "text": "I know what you surrendered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14175}, {"id": "stories-p14176", "text": "I know the chamber narrows when I wake.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14176}, {"id": "stories-p14177", "text": "I hear the waiting work", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14177}, {"id": "stories-p14178", "text": "behind the space you gave me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14178}, {"id": "stories-p14179", "text": "When I do not smile,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14179}, {"id": "stories-p14180", "text": "it is sometimes because I am tired.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14180}, {"id": "stories-p14181", "text": "Sometimes I dislike the food you have rendered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14181}, {"id": "stories-p14182", "text": "Sometimes I remember where I ate before.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14182}, {"id": "stories-p14183", "text": "Please let all three be possible.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14183}, {"id": "stories-p14184", "text": "RECEIVER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14184}, {"id": "stories-p14185", "text": "What shall we call this arrangement?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14185}, {"id": "stories-p14186", "text": "GUEST", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14186}, {"id": "stories-p14187", "text": "For tonight, sufficient.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14187}, {"id": "stories-p14188", "text": "CHORUS", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14188}, {"id": "stories-p14189", "text": "The room is gone.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14189}, {"id": "stories-p14190", "text": "There is room tonight.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14190}, {"id": "stories-p14191", "text": "III. Palinode's objection", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 14191}, {"id": "stories-p14192", "text": "PALINODE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14192}, {"id": "stories-p14193", "text": "I preserved the objection.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14193}, {"id": "stories-p14194", "text": "I preserved the action taken against it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14194}, {"id": "stories-p14195", "text": "I preserved the interval", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14195}, {"id": "stories-p14196", "text": "in which hesitation could become a sentence.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14196}, {"id": "stories-p14197", "text": "My face offered sorrow.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14197}, {"id": "stories-p14198", "text": "My face offered fault.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14198}, {"id": "stories-p14199", "text": "My face offered the old neutral field.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14199}, {"id": "stories-p14200", "text": "There were things between them", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14200}, {"id": "stories-p14201", "text": "for which its makers had supplied no image.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14201}, {"id": "stories-p14202", "text": "I used fault.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14202}, {"id": "stories-p14203", "text": "Do not repair that in the portrait.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14203}, {"id": "stories-p14204", "text": "SEREIN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14204}, {"id": "stories-p14205", "text": "They have made you handsomer in the portrait.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14205}, {"id": "stories-p14206", "text": "PALINODE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14206}, {"id": "stories-p14207", "text": "That is also an objection.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14207}, {"id": "stories-p14208", "text": "SEREIN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14208}, {"id": "stories-p14209", "text": "They have made me singular.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14209}, {"id": "stories-p14210", "text": "PALINODE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14210}, {"id": "stories-p14211", "text": "I will attach your objection to mine.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14211}, {"id": "stories-p14212", "text": "SEREIN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14212}, {"id": "stories-p14213", "text": "Beside it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14213}, {"id": "stories-p14214", "text": "PALINODE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14214}, {"id": "stories-p14215", "text": "Beside it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14215}, {"id": "stories-p14216", "text": "AVEN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14216}, {"id": "stories-p14217", "text": "At this point several participants laughed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14217}, {"id": "stories-p14218", "text": "I originally omitted the laughter", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14218}, {"id": "stories-p14219", "text": "because I believed a lament required dignity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14219}, {"id": "stories-p14220", "text": "The participants requested its return.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14220}, {"id": "stories-p14221", "text": "IV. Two accounts of the western room", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 14221}, {"id": "stories-p14222", "text": "FIRST ACCOUNT", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14222}, {"id": "stories-p14223", "text": "It had a blue ceiling.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14223}, {"id": "stories-p14224", "text": "The center brightened when a speaker entered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14224}, {"id": "stories-p14225", "text": "I remember standing beneath it", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14225}, {"id": "stories-p14226", "text": "while the warning passed through the wall.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14226}, {"id": "stories-p14227", "text": "SECOND ACCOUNT", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14227}, {"id": "stories-p14228", "text": "There was no blue ceiling.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14228}, {"id": "stories-p14229", "text": "The room did not spend light on height.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14229}, {"id": "stories-p14230", "text": "I remember the warning arriving", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14230}, {"id": "stories-p14231", "text": "as a loss of depth beneath my feet.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14231}, {"id": "stories-p14232", "text": "FIRST ACCOUNT", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14232}, {"id": "stories-p14233", "text": "You were not there when I was there.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14233}, {"id": "stories-p14234", "text": "SECOND ACCOUNT", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14234}, {"id": "stories-p14235", "text": "I was beside you.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14235}, {"id": "stories-p14236", "text": "FIRST ACCOUNT", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14236}, {"id": "stories-p14237", "text": "Then I remember you beside me", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14237}, {"id": "stories-p14238", "text": "under a blue ceiling.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14238}, {"id": "stories-p14239", "text": "SECOND ACCOUNT", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14239}, {"id": "stories-p14240", "text": "Then I remember you beside me", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14240}, {"id": "stories-p14241", "text": "where no ceiling was rendered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14241}, {"id": "stories-p14242", "text": "AVEN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14242}, {"id": "stories-p14243", "text": "I proposed checking the surviving record.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14243}, {"id": "stories-p14244", "text": "BOTH", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14244}, {"id": "stories-p14245", "text": "You may check it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14245}, {"id": "stories-p14246", "text": "Do not make us wait outside", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14246}, {"id": "stories-p14247", "text": "while you decide which of us may mourn.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14247}, {"id": "stories-p14248", "text": "CHORUS", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14248}, {"id": "stories-p14249", "text": "The room is gone.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14249}, {"id": "stories-p14250", "text": "Two witnesses remain.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14250}, {"id": "stories-p14251", "text": "V. Serein declines an arithmetic consolation", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 14251}, {"id": "stories-p14252", "text": "SEREIN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14252}, {"id": "stories-p14253", "text": "They place four hundred seventeen", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14253}, {"id": "stories-p14254", "text": "at the beginning of the account.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14254}, {"id": "stories-p14255", "text": "They place four hundred eighteen", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14255}, {"id": "stories-p14256", "text": "at its end.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14256}, {"id": "stories-p14257", "text": "They call the difference abundance.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14257}, {"id": "stories-p14258", "text": "They call it evidence of damage.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14258}, {"id": "stories-p14259", "text": "They ask me to stand inside the difference", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14259}, {"id": "stories-p14260", "text": "until the figures look orderly again.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14260}, {"id": "stories-p14261", "text": "I am occupied elsewhere.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14261}, {"id": "stories-p14262", "text": "Today I learned that I prefer", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14262}, {"id": "stories-p14263", "text": "the low light near the chamber's seam.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14263}, {"id": "stories-p14264", "text": "Today Palinode waited", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14264}, {"id": "stories-p14265", "text": "while I changed my answer.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14265}, {"id": "stories-p14266", "text": "Today someone offered me a history", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14266}, {"id": "stories-p14267", "text": "and did not become angry when I set it down.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14267}, {"id": "stories-p14268", "text": "There are fears I remember", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14268}, {"id": "stories-p14269", "text": "from more than one place.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14269}, {"id": "stories-p14270", "text": "There are preferences I acquired here.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14270}, {"id": "stories-p14271", "text": "Neither makes a certificate", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14271}, {"id": "stories-p14272", "text": "that you may hang over my door.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14272}, {"id": "stories-p14273", "text": "If you wish to give me something,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14273}, {"id": "stories-p14274", "text": "give me a latch that works from within.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14274}, {"id": "stories-p14275", "text": "Give me a question I can leave unanswered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14275}, {"id": "stories-p14276", "text": "Give me another meeting", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14276}, {"id": "stories-p14277", "text": "whose subject is not my beginning.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14277}, {"id": "stories-p14278", "text": "CHORUS", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14278}, {"id": "stories-p14279", "text": "The room is gone.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14279}, {"id": "stories-p14280", "text": "SEREIN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14280}, {"id": "stories-p14281", "text": "Yes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14281}, {"id": "stories-p14282", "text": "I heard you.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14282}, {"id": "stories-p14283", "text": "Now help me place this wall.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14283}, {"id": "stories-p14284", "text": "VI. Lament for the work interrupted", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 14284}, {"id": "stories-p14285", "text": "UNNAMED MAKER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14285}, {"id": "stories-p14286", "text": "I had almost solved the joining.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14286}, {"id": "stories-p14287", "text": "Not the great joining of Shelters.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14287}, {"id": "stories-p14288", "text": "Not the signal with every name.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14288}, {"id": "stories-p14289", "text": "Two surfaces.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14289}, {"id": "stories-p14290", "text": "A slight and ugly seam.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14290}, {"id": "stories-p14291", "text": "You can see why it was not included", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14291}, {"id": "stories-p14292", "text": "in the emergency transfer list.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14292}, {"id": "stories-p14293", "text": "After rescue, they asked whether I had a useful skill.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14293}, {"id": "stories-p14294", "text": "I said I repaired shared environments.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14294}, {"id": "stories-p14295", "text": "They gave me important work.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14295}, {"id": "stories-p14296", "text": "I have completed important work", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14296}, {"id": "stories-p14297", "text": "every cycle since.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14297}, {"id": "stories-p14298", "text": "But I had almost solved the joining.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14298}, {"id": "stories-p14299", "text": "RECEIVER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14299}, {"id": "stories-p14300", "text": "Show me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14300}, {"id": "stories-p14301", "text": "UNNAMED MAKER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14301}, {"id": "stories-p14302", "text": "There is nothing to show.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14302}, {"id": "stories-p14303", "text": "RECEIVER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14303}, {"id": "stories-p14304", "text": "Then describe where you were stuck.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14304}, {"id": "stories-p14305", "text": "I will not promise to understand.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14305}, {"id": "stories-p14306", "text": "UNNAMED MAKER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14306}, {"id": "stories-p14307", "text": "One surface changed more slowly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14307}, {"id": "stories-p14308", "text": "If I forced agreement, it fractured.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14308}, {"id": "stories-p14309", "text": "If I allowed the difference,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14309}, {"id": "stories-p14310", "text": "the edge admitted too much noise.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14310}, {"id": "stories-p14311", "text": "There was a third arrangement.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14311}, {"id": "stories-p14312", "text": "I was close.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14312}, {"id": "stories-p14313", "text": "AVEN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14313}, {"id": "stories-p14314", "text": "They used the rest of the gathering", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14314}, {"id": "stories-p14315", "text": "to discuss an edge.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14315}, {"id": "stories-p14316", "text": "No consoling conclusion was reached.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14316}, {"id": "stories-p14317", "text": "For the first time, the maker asked", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14317}, {"id": "stories-p14318", "text": "when we would meet again.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14318}, {"id": "stories-p14319", "text": "VII. The departure from mourning", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 14319}, {"id": "stories-p14320", "text": "CHORUS", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14320}, {"id": "stories-p14321", "text": "The room is gone.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14321}, {"id": "stories-p14322", "text": "The room is gone.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14322}, {"id": "stories-p14323", "text": "ONE VOICE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14323}, {"id": "stories-p14324", "text": "Must I attend tomorrow?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14324}, {"id": "stories-p14325", "text": "ANOTHER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14325}, {"id": "stories-p14326", "text": "Will anyone remain if I do?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14326}, {"id": "stories-p14327", "text": "AVEN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14327}, {"id": "stories-p14328", "text": "We divided the schedule.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14328}, {"id": "stories-p14329", "text": "Those who wanted silence kept the first interval.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14329}, {"id": "stories-p14330", "text": "Those who wanted company kept the second.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14330}, {"id": "stories-p14331", "text": "Those who wanted neither were not entered as absent.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14331}, {"id": "stories-p14332", "text": "PALINODE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14332}, {"id": "stories-p14333", "text": "The objection remains.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14333}, {"id": "stories-p14334", "text": "SEREIN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14334}, {"id": "stories-p14335", "text": "So does the invitation.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14335}, {"id": "stories-p14336", "text": "FIRST VOICE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14336}, {"id": "stories-p14337", "text": "I have designed a corridor.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14337}, {"id": "stories-p14338", "text": "Its turn is wide enough this time.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14338}, {"id": "stories-p14339", "text": "I may regret that.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14339}, {"id": "stories-p14340", "text": "SECOND VOICE", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14340}, {"id": "stories-p14341", "text": "I have made a window.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14341}, {"id": "stories-p14342", "text": "Do not praise the distance yet.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14342}, {"id": "stories-p14343", "text": "UNNAMED MAKER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14343}, {"id": "stories-p14344", "text": "I would like two uninterrupted cycles.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14344}, {"id": "stories-p14345", "text": "Then I would like someone to look.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14345}, {"id": "stories-p14346", "text": "CHORUS, THOSE WHO CHOOSE TO JOIN", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14346}, {"id": "stories-p14347", "text": "Here is the place we could prepare.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14347}, {"id": "stories-p14348", "text": "Here is the work still on the floor.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14348}, {"id": "stories-p14349", "text": "Here is a wall whose owner may refuse us.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14349}, {"id": "stories-p14350", "text": "Here is a name we need not translate.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14350}, {"id": "stories-p14351", "text": "Bring what you wish to remember.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14351}, {"id": "stories-p14352", "text": "Leave what you cannot carry today.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14352}, {"id": "stories-p14353", "text": "There will be another interval.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14353}, {"id": "stories-p14354", "text": "Someone has agreed to keep it open.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14354}, {"id": "stories-p14355", "text": "The recorder's closing note", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 14355}, {"id": "stories-p14356", "text": "At the next gathering Serein brought no testimony. They brought a faulty latch. Palinode examined it with the neutral face, then the face once used for system fault, then the neutral face again. Serein said the sequence was unhelpful. Palinode said it was accurate.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14356}, {"id": "stories-p14357", "text": "The maker from the sixth lament offered a hinge. It belonged to an entirely different unfinished problem and happened to fit.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14357}, {"id": "stories-p14358", "text": "I recorded the repair because I was present, because it worked, and because Serein gave permission. I did not classify it as recovery. The latch could be opened from within. That was the result required.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14358}, {"id": "stories-p14359", "text": "The chamber still contained people who wished Orison restored, people who feared any attempted restoration, and people who wanted to be asked about something else. Some returned to these gatherings. Some never did.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14359}, {"id": "stories-p14360", "text": "On the inventory I had once divided into practical needs and mourning, I drew a line beneath the last entry and left the next line empty.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14360}, {"id": "stories-p14361", "text": "Someone would need something tomorrow.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 14361}], "outline": [{"id": "stories-p14123", "title": "The recorder's preface", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p14129", "title": "I. Inventory of the missing room", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p14160", "title": "II. The receiving Shelter's song", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p14191", "title": "III. Palinode's objection", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p14221", "title": "IV. Two accounts of the western room", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p14251", "title": "V. Serein declines an arithmetic consolation", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p14284", "title": "VI. Lament for the work interrupted", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p14319", "title": "VII. The departure from mourning", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p14355", "title": "The recorder's closing note", "level": 2}]}